      {
        "index": 2,
        "text": "After getting his diploma, he devoted his life to writing poems. Using concrete but flexible language and the minimum of words is his style. He tried out different patterns and preferred nursery rhyme in particular.",
        "zh": "获得文凭之后，他把一生奉献给了诗歌创作。使用具体而灵活的语言、尽可能少的词，是他的风格。他尝试不同的形式，尤其喜欢童谣。",
