      {
        "index": 3,
        "text": "The following is a translation of one of his works made up of 3 sections: Little sparrow with heavy load, Ran out of energy and very cold; No compass and all sweat salty, Can you go through the endless darkness? Little balloon let out by the thread, Flew over cottages and was very glad; With warmth transformed from sunlight, He said he could forever fly; Take it easy, little balloon; Don’t tease the sparrow with his wound; On the bare branch and have a rest; This diamond heart will eventually get success.",
        "zh": "下面是他的一篇作品的译文，由三节组成：背着沉重负担的小麻雀，耗尽了力气，又十分寒冷；没有指南针，流出的汗水咸咸的，你能穿过这无边的黑暗吗？从线绳上放开的小气球，飞过村舍，心里很欢喜；带着阳光转化成的温暖，它说自己能永远飞翔；放轻松，小气球，别取笑受了伤的小麻雀；在光秃秃的树枝上歇一歇；这颗钻石般坚强的心，终将获得成功。",
        "start": 108.28,
